  The system is designed to work as a crowd-sourced missing person detection network where:
  1. Users can report missing persons with photos
  2. The system extracts face encodings from uploaded photos
  3. Camera volunteers scan faces in real-time
  4. Detected faces are compared against the missing persons database
  5. When matches are found, notifications are sent to relevant parties
  6. The network coordinates between all active camera nodes


